[Tips.パスに沿って配置σ@Path_S]
effect.name=Places objects along the path. Can space out individual objects.\nThe relative coordinates between individual objects are reflected as is without following the path. Use "Zoom Coordinate(Individual)" to the scale 0 before this, so they will be placed them along the path.
個別位置ズレ=Offset length between each individual object, in percentage of total path length
範囲外=Specifies whether to display objects that do not lie between the start and end of the path.
曲線精度=Maximum sampling interval for polyline approximation, in pixels
パスの表示=Displays the path shape in the preview window. Automatically disabled during video export.

